<%- include('partials/header') %>

<!-- Return Policy -->
<section class="pt-32 pb-16 bg-orange-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <h1 class="header-title text-4xl text-center text-gray-800 mb-6">Return Policy</h1>
        <div class="prose max-w-3xl mx-auto text-gray-700">

            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB') %></p>

            <p>At BagVati, we strive to provide high-quality products and a seamless shopping experience. This Return Policy outlines when and how customers may return or exchange items purchased through our Platform.</p>

            <h3>1. Return / Exchange Window</h3>
            <p>Customers may request a return or exchange within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>. After 7 days, we cannot offer returns, exchanges, or refunds.</p>

            <h3>2. Eligibility for Return / Exchange</h3>
            <p>To qualify for a return or exchange:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>The item must be unused, unworn, and in the same condition as delivered.</li>
                <li>It must be returned with original packaging, tags, labels, and accessories.</li>
                <li>Products purchased during a sale or marked as <strong>non-returnable</strong> may not be eligible.</li>
            </ol>
            <p>Only defective, damaged, or incorrect items may be eligible for replacement subject to verification.</p>

            <h3>3. Non-Returnable Items</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Items damaged due to misuse, negligence, or improper handling.</li>
                <li>Products missing original packaging or accessories.</li>
                <li>Final sale items, special discount items, or items marked as non-returnable.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>4. Return Request Process</h3>
            <p>To initiate a return or exchange, customers must:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Submit a return request within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> if the item is defective, damaged, or incorrect.</li>
                <li>Provide clear photo/video proof of the issue.</li>
                <li>Wait for BagVati’s quality verification and approval.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>After we receive and inspect the returned item, customers will be notified via email regarding approval or rejection of the request.</p>

            <h3>5. Refunds (if applicable)</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Refunds (if approved) will be initiated to the original payment method.</li>
                <li>Refund processing time is typically <strong>5–7 working days</strong> depending on the bank or payment provider.</li>
                <li>Shipping fees (if charged) are non-refundable.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>6. Exchange Policy</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Exchanges are subject to stock availability.</li>
                <li>If the requested product is unavailable, customers may opt for a refund instead.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>7. Shipping & Return Logistics</h3>
            <p>Orders are shipped through registered domestic courier partners or India Post. Dispatch typically occurs within 3 business days of order confirmation, subject to courier timelines.</p>
            <p>Delivery timelines vary based on location, courier operations, and external factors. BagVati is not responsible for delays caused by third-party logistics providers.</p>

            <p>Products must be returned to the pickup address communicated by BagVati. Return shipping fees may apply unless the product delivered was defective or incorrect.</p>

            <h3>8. Delivery Address & Notifications</h3>
            <p>Orders will be delivered to the address provided during purchase. Delivery updates and confirmation will be sent via email or SMS.</p>

            <h3>9. Exempted Categories</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Certain items may be exempted from returns due to hygiene, safety, or product-type restrictions. These will be clearly indicated at the time of purchase.</p>

            <h3>10. Contact & Support</h3>
            <p>For return, refund, or exchange support, contact us at:</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
                Email: <a href="mailto:support@bagvati.works" class="text-blue-600 underline">support@bagvati.works</a><br>
                Business Hours: Monday - Friday (09:00 AM - 06:00 PM)
            </p>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
